Package: powermean
Type: Package
Title: Power-Mean Regression with Fixed Effects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("David", "Benatia", email = "dbenatia@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Estimates conditional power means with and without fixed
    effects. Provides inference for Poisson and Gamma pseudo-maximum
    likelihood and log least squares. Implements the two-way estimators of
    Jochmans (2017) <doi:10.1162/REST_a_00620> for complete rectangular
    panels and directed dyads. Includes prediction, proportional contrasts,
    and clustered and heteroskedasticity-consistent covariance estimators.
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dvbn/powermean-R
BugReports: https://github.com/dvbn/powermean-R/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: C++17
Imports: highs, Matrix, methods, stats, utils
LinkingTo: BH, RcppEigen
Suggests: fixest, haven, jsonlite, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
NeedsCompilation: yes
